---
title: "withdrawExcessInvestedCapital (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_investor: caller is investor with position
    q_check_investor --> q_check_claimed: hasClaimedExcess == false
    q_check_investor --> q_revert_claimed: already claimed
    q_revert_claimed --> [*]: revert AlreadyClaimed
    q_check_claimed --> q_verify_merkle: verify Merkle proof for accepted amount
    q_check_claimed --> q_revert_proof: invalid Merkle proof
    q_revert_proof --> [*]: revert InvalidMerkleProof
    q_verify_merkle --> q_calc_excess: proof valid, acceptedAmount verified
    q_calc_excess --> q_check_excess: excessAmount = investedCapital - acceptedAmount
    q_check_excess --> q_transfer: excessAmount > 0
    q_check_excess --> q_revert_no_excess: no excess
    q_revert_no_excess --> [*]: revert NoExcessCapital
    q_transfer --> q_update: transfer excessAmount of bidToken to investor
    q_update --> [*]: hasClaimedExcess = true, emit ExcessCapitalWithdrawn

    note right of q_verify_merkle
        INV-001: Merkle proof verification replaces signature verification (vs Approved variant)
        INV-002: acceptedAmount determined by project evaluation
        INV-003: excess = investedCapital - acceptedAmount (never negative)
    end note
